{
  "id": "views",
  "label": "Horizontal / vertical",
  "hint": "Find the same appointment in both views.",
  "anchor": "horizontal-first",
  "initial": {
    "view": "infinite-horizontal",
    "theme": "system",
    "density": 22,
    "zoom": 2,
    "controls": ["view"]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "action": "find",
      "target": "[data-event-id=\"2026-10-19-event-0\"]"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "action": "click",
      "target": "[data-action=\"vertical\"]",
      "caption": "Click Vertical"
    },
    {
      "action": "hover",
      "target": "[data-event-id=\"2026-10-19-event-0\"]"
    },
    {
      "action": "scroll-day",
      "target": ".quno-calendar-viewport",
      "cell": "[data-slot=\"calendar-cell\"][data-date=\"2026-10-19\"][data-calendar-id=\"person-0\"]",
      "horizontalAmount": 800,
      "verticalOffset": 100,
      "durationMs": 1000,
      "easing": "ease-in-out"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 350
    },
    {
      "action": "click",
      "target": "[data-action=\"horizontal\"]",
      "caption": "Click Horizontal"
    },
    {
      "action": "hover",
      "target": "[data-event-id=\"2026-10-20-event-0\"]"
    },
    {
      "action": "scroll-day",
      "target": ".quno-calendar-viewport",
      "cell": "[data-slot=\"calendar-cell\"][data-date=\"2026-10-20\"][data-calendar-id=\"person-0\"]",
      "horizontalAmount": 800,
      "verticalOffset": 100,
      "durationMs": 1000,
      "easing": "ease-in-out"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "action": "scroll-to",
      "target": ".quno-calendar-viewport",
      "destination": "[data-slot=\"calendar-day-header\"][data-date=\"2026-10-19\"]",
      "align": "start",
      "caption": "Return through the schedule",
      "durationMs": 1000,
      "easing": "ease-in-out"
    },
    {
      "action": "hover",
      "target": "[data-event-id=\"2026-10-19-event-0\"]"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    }
  ],
  "paragraphs": [
    "People have strong habits, so I added a more traditional infinite view in which both days and time run vertically.",
    "Both orientations support the same interactions. Choose the horizontal timeline or the vertical view without changing the way you navigate, create, or move appointments."
  ],
  "loop": "continue"
}
